# Tutorial: Hostile Resource Harvesting Mechanics

## 1. Stealth Takedown Techniques

### 1.1 Stealth Takedown Mechanics

Stealth takedowns require careful timing and positioning. When an NPC is detected, the player must wait until their health bar is depleted before initiating the takedown.

```csharp
public class StealthTakedown : MonoBehaviour
{
    public float cooldown = 0.5f;
    public float waitTime = 0.5f;
    public float damage = 10f;

    private bool isTaken = false;

    void Update()
    {
        if (isTaken) return;

        if (Input.GetKeyDown(KeyCode.E))
        {
            TakeDown();
        }
    }

    void TakeDown()
    {
        isTaken = true;
        StartCoroutine(WaitForTakedown());
    }

    IEnumerator WaitForTakedown()
    {
        yield return new WaitForSeconds(waitTime);
        isTaken = false;
    }
}
```

